-- a context's entry for a variable: its type, and its form at that type, computed once when the
-- variable enters (measured 2026-11-22: computing the form at every occurrence on every round
-- cost 2.46e9 steps for one variable of an equivalence type; the form is 108 nodes)
nk-ent : NkTm → NkTm → NkTm
nk-ent ty form = nk-con #50 (nk-cons ty (nk-cons form nk-nil))
